  "title": "Archrock Reports First Quarter 2026 Results",
  "summary": "HOUSTON, May 05, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) - Archrock, Inc. (NYSE: AROC) (“Archrock” or the “Company”) today reported results for the first quarter 2026. First Quarter 2026 Highlights Revenue for the first quarter of 2026 was $373.8 million compared to $347.2 million in the first quarter of 2025. Net income for the first quarter of 2026 was $73.8 million and EPS was $0.41, an increase of approximately 4.1% and 2.5%, respectively, compared to $70.9 million and $0.40, respectively, in the first quarte",
